# S24: Deployment + Monitoring

## Objective

Deploy all apps to production: Vercel (docs, work-control) + NuxtHub for DB-backed
apps. Add health check endpoints, structured logging to production sink, Sentry for
error tracking. Establish a monitoring baseline so incidents are caught before users
report them.

## Stack

- **Platform**: Vercel (NuxtHub preset) or Cloudflare Pages
- **DB**: Supabase (S23) via CORE_DATASOURCE_*
- **Errors**: Sentry (or self-hosted Glitchtip)
- **Logs**: structured logs already in place (S03); wire to Logtail / Axiom

## Tasks

- [ ] S24-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S24-T02-NuxtHubConfig.pd          — hub.remote config, NuxtHub token, env vars
- [ ] S24-T03-VercelDeploy.pd           — vercel.json + deploy each app
- [ ] S24-T04-HealthEndpoint.pd         — /api/health for each app: DB + WS ping
- [ ] S24-T05-SentryIntegration.pd      — @sentry/nuxt, source maps, release tracking
- [ ] S24-T06-LogSink.pd                — wire structured-logging to Logtail / Axiom
- [ ] S24-T07-AlertRules.pd             — alert on 5xx spike, WS disconnect rate
- [ ] S24-T08-KnowledgeUpdate.pd        — deployment + monitoring slugs
- [ ] S24-T09-SmokeProduction.pd        — full smoke on production URL

## Definition of Done

- [ ] All apps live on public URL (or staging subdomain)
- [ ] Sentry captures real errors with source maps
- [ ] `/api/health` returns 200 with DB status
- [ ] Alert fires on simulated error spike
- [ ] `bun run test` passes against prod URLs (smoke only, no mutations)

## App-agent protocol

All tasks follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.

